#: bresca
msgid ""
"Usage: bresca <command> [options]\n"
"\n"
"Commands:\n"
"  version     Print the running BrescaOS version\n"
"  updates     Manage BrescaOS updates\n"
"  help        Show this help\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  -h, --help  Show this help\n"
"\n"
"Run 'bresca <command> --help' for its options."
msgstr ""
"Ús: bresca <ordre> [opcions]\n"
"\n"
"Ordres:\n"
"  version     Mostra la versió de BrescaOS en ús\n"
"  updates     Gestiona les actualitzacions de BrescaOS\n"
"  help        Mostra aquesta ajuda\n"
"\n"
"Opcions:\n"
"  -h, --help  Mostra aquesta ajuda\n"
"\n"
"Executa 'bresca <ordre> --help' per veure'n les opcions."

#: bresca
msgid ""
"Usage: bresca updates <subcommand> [options]\n"
"\n"
"Subcommands:\n"
"  status      Current, staged and rollback versions (root)\n"
"  check       Check whether an update is available (root)\n"
"  download    Download the newer version without installing it (root)\n"
"  install     Install the downloaded version (root)\n"
"  rollback    Boot the previous version next time (root)\n"
"  registry    Where updates come from: image, registry, TLS (root)\n"
"  help        Show this help\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  -h, --help  Show this help\n"
"\n"
"Run 'bresca updates <subcommand> --help' for its options."
msgstr ""
"Ús: bresca updates <subordre> [opcions]\n"
"\n"
"Subordres:\n"
"  status      Versions actual, preparada i anterior (root)\n"
"  check       Comprova si hi ha una actualització disponible (root)\n"
"  download    Baixa la versió nova sense instal·lar-la (root)\n"
"  install     Instal·la la versió baixada (root)\n"
"  rollback    Arrenca la versió anterior la propera vegada (root)\n"
"  registry    D'on arriben les actualitzacions: imatge, registre, TLS (root)\n"
"  help        Mostra aquesta ajuda\n"
"\n"
"Opcions:\n"
"  -h, --help  Mostra aquesta ajuda\n"
"\n"
"Executa 'bresca updates <subordre> --help' per veure'n les opcions."

#: commands/updates/check
msgid ""
"Usage: sudo bresca updates check [--format=json|text]\n"
"\n"
"Checks whether a newer BrescaOS version is available, without downloading\n"
"or changing anything.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  --format=json  Print {checked_at, update_available, current_version,\n"
"                 available_version}, or {checked_at, error}\n"
"  -h, --help     Show this help"
msgstr ""
"Ús: sudo bresca updates check [--format=json|text]\n"
"\n"
"Comprova si hi ha una versió més nova de BrescaOS, sense baixar ni canviar\n"
"res.\n"
"\n"
"Opcions:\n"
"  --format=json  Mostra {checked_at, update_available, current_version,\n"
"                 available_version}, o {checked_at, error}\n"
"  -h, --help     Mostra aquesta ajuda"

#: commands/updates/check commands/updates/download commands/updates/install
